flowchart LR
    A[Config files] --> B[Resolve base and overrides]
    B --> C[Validate DQNConfig and device]
    C --> D[Manifest with pending variants]
    D --> E{Variant remains?}
    E -->|yes| F[One sequential DQNTrainer run]
    F --> G{CUDA request available?}
    G -->|yes| H[metrics.csv + runtime metadata + summary]
    G -->|no| I[Blocked; no CPU fallback]
    H --> E
    I --> E
    E -->|no| J[Compare fixed windows]
    J --> K[Plot by environment step]
